      "created_at": "2013-03-16T19:42:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Am I correct in thinking that when she would be dealt damage, the \"move a card from under this card to the appropriate trash. If you do, prevent that damage\" clause takes precedence over the \"redirect that damage to the non-Villain Target with the highest HP\" clause, because it's written before it on the card?</p>",
