      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Am I correct in thinking that when she would be dealt damage, the &quot;move a card from under this card to the appropriate trash. If you do, prevent that damage&quot; clause takes precedence over the &quot;redirect that damage to the non-Villain Target with the highest HP&quot; clause, because it&#39;s written before it on the card?</p>",
