      "name": "broccoli",
      "username": "broccoli",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/broccoli/{size}/1861_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-19T18:44:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I asked Christopher and he said the small card is correct and the big card is incorrect, thus it IS once per round. &nbsp;While that may seem underpowered, once per turn is downright ridiculous against heroes that only inflict damage once a turn.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Whether that or removing the card takes precedence first.....I forgot to ask, but my guess is you do the once per round redirection, then you start removing cards.</p>",
