      "created_at": "2013-03-19T20:35:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In all honesty, once per turn makes it to where she flips almost immediately with enough damage dealing One-Shots/Powers.&nbsp; In playtesting, we rarely had her flipped for a whole round.&nbsp; I'm pretty ok with making her flip condition a little more relevant.&nbsp; I'll have to play her a few times to get a feel for it.</p>",
